# Fiendish Panda: "Whenever you gain life, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature." On turn 1 Bot1 gains 3 life from Healing Salve and the
# Panda (3/2) gets one counter and is a 4/3. On turn 2 Bot2 gains 3 life from its own Healing Salve: no counter. On turn 3 Swords to
# Plowshares exiles Bot1's own Ornithopter (power 0): Bot1 gains 0 life, which is no life gained, so there is no counter either.

